{"id":7,"date":"2019-10-03T19:13:57","date_gmt":"2019-10-03T19:13:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/testdrive\/?page_id=2"},"modified":"2020-07-05T01:16:22","modified_gmt":"2020-07-05T01:16:22","slug":"overview","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/","title":{"rendered":"Overview"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-very-light-gray-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>IJCAR 2020 has concluded!<\/strong> You can watch the recordings of the YouTube livestreams in the following playlists: <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/playlist?list=PLl1dj5prwUJzc1P5_k4GvlUrmwo3OWrUU\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Day 1<\/strong><\/a>, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/playlist?list=PLl1dj5prwUJxb7273pa1PlaG6Y9-ek2w7\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Day 2<\/strong><\/a>, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/playlist?list=PLl1dj5prwUJz6KV4Q1EPG9Gx0bjiKa_ey\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Day 3<\/strong><\/a>, <strong><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/playlist?list=PLl1dj5prwUJzOTayo7HeQhbQ2Zmumif3L\" target=\"_blank\">Day 4<\/a><\/strong>.<br><br>See you next year for <a href=\"http:\/\/cade-28.info\/\"><strong>CADE-28 in Pittsburgh, USA<\/strong><\/a>, and <strong>IJCAR-11 in Haifa, Israel<\/strong>!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <strong>International Joint Conference on Automated Reasoning<\/strong> (<a href=\"http:\/\/ijcar.org\">IJCAR<\/a>)  is the premier international joint conference on all topics in automated reasoning. The IJCAR 2020 technical program will consist of presentations of high-quality original research papers, short papers describing interesting work in progress,&nbsp; system descriptions, and invited talks. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IJCAR 2020 is the 10th edition of IJCAR. It will be held in Paris (France), and will be co-located with <a href=\"http:\/\/fscd2020.org\">FSCD 2020<\/a> and a number of workshops and associated events.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-very-dark-gray-color has-very-light-gray-background-color wp-block-paragraph\">More information on the <a href=\"https:\/\/fscd-ijcar-2020.org\">IJCAR-FSCD 2020 joint meeting website<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IJCAR 2020 is the merger of the following leading events in automated reasoning:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.cadeinc.org\/\">CADE<\/a> (Conference on Automated Deduction) <\/li><li><a href=\"http:\/\/frocos.cs.uiowa.edu\/\">FroCoS<\/a> (Symposium on Frontiers of Combining Systems)<\/li><li>ITP (International Conference on Interactive Theorem Proving)<\/li><li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.tableaux-ar.org\/\">TABLEAUX<\/a> (Conference on Analytic Tableaux and Related Methods)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <a href=\"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/01\/IJCAR2020-CFP.txt\">Call for Papers<\/a> can be downloaded in plain text format.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Proceedings will be published by Springer in the LNAI subseries of <a href=\"http:\/\/www.springer.com\/it\/computer-science\/lncs\">LNCS<\/a>. Previous IJCAR proceedings are available <a href=\"https:\/\/link.springer.com\/conference\/ijcar\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/07\/report.pdf\">PC Chairs Report (pdf)<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>IJCAR 2020 has concluded! You can watch the recordings of the YouTube livestreams in the following playlists: Day 1, Day 2, Day 3, Day 4. See you next year for CADE-28 in Pittsburgh, USA, and IJCAR-11 in Haifa, Israel! The International Joint Conference on Automated Reasoning (IJCAR) is the premier international joint conference on all&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":1,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-7","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/7","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/7\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":250,"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/7\/revisions\/250"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ijcar2020.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}